{"steam_appid":3997700,"steam_name":"Where Is Mommy","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3997700/1014504646/d9db7f6c34827aaa6e75f645419d0636d7edc5a8/1764474654/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764476713","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257240633/d4249489dc342a5ec26529bf3a2b29e4048e0b49/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764476713","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/79f4067f6540b487b52721dbd3edceab9d867180/ss_79f4067f6540b487b52721dbd3edceab9d867180.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783220314","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/af9dacceb2955ed220cf8eab7f6306426ac5cb73/ss_af9dacceb2955ed220cf8eab7f6306426ac5cb73.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783220314","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/dc68e874a23a06905c378e232eb7c3ead775096d/ss_dc68e874a23a06905c378e232eb7c3ead775096d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783220314","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/0c702e5105cbdb8beb09d82d49811cecd9310769/ss_0c702e5105cbdb8beb09d82d49811cecd9310769.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783220314","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/d2aa1e108bc1b5c698a40a3db90b2a1c4910b68a/ss_d2aa1e108bc1b5c698a40a3db90b2a1c4910b68a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783220314"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you find your way back, or will the loop become your new reality?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/fd6d1a3435f6e946c680503a6f9f70d1.poster.avif?t=1783220314\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/fd6d1a3435f6e946c680503a6f9f70d1.webm?t=1783220314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/fd6d1a3435f6e946c680503a6f9f70d1.mp4?t=1783220314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey begins in an endless bazaar where the cycle never stays the same. Each loop twists reality further and pulls you into surreal spaces beyond imagination. You are a lost child chasing the faint traces of your mother through shifting environments where nothing feels quite right.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/8885f5b4e271cad1d694c45fa5b9fd87.poster.avif?t=1783220314\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/8885f5b4e271cad1d694c45fa5b9fd87.webm?t=1783220314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/8885f5b4e271cad1d694c45fa5b9fd87.mp4?t=1783220314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalies seep into the world as subtle wrongness that grows more distorted the longer you stay. You must notice what does not belong to survive the loop and uncover where the path is truly leading. Will you find her or will this shifting world swallow you first?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/9e61167c52a85dba4eefeb36c43620cb.poster.avif?t=1783220314\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/9e61167c52a85dba4eefeb36c43620cb.webm?t=1783220314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/9e61167c52a85dba4eefeb36c43620cb.mp4?t=1783220314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spot the Anomalies:</strong> Pay close attention to your surroundings. Even the smallest change can be the difference between progression and starting over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifting Reality:</strong> Experience an environment that evolves with every cycle, turning familiar paths into uncanny landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> Immerse yourself in an atmosphere designed to keep you on edge, focusing on dread and discovery rather than simple jump-scares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery:</strong> Piece together the story of a lost child through environmental storytelling and haunting encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/e7121d07e76af2111e6f41883ca19b1b.poster.avif?t=1783220314\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997700/extras/e7121d07e76af2111e6f41883ca19b1b.webm?t=1783220314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8800 / ATI Radeon HD 4650 / Intel HD Graphics</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Calm Hyena Interactive"],"publishers":["Calm Hyena Interactive"],"release_date":"Jul 4, 2026"}